</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Today the Savior calls;</l><l>O hear Him now!</l><l>Before your day is gone,</l><l>To Jesus bow.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Today the Savior calls;</l><l>For refuge fly;</l><l>The storm of vengeance falls,</l><l>And death is nigh.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Spirit calls today;</l><l>Yield to His pow’r;</l><l>O grieve Him not away,</l><l>’Tis mercy’s hour!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
